---
title: Review state machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> submitted: guest writes after a completed stay
    submitted --> published: both sides wrote or 14 days passed
    published --> flagged: report received
    flagged --> published: admin dismisses
    flagged --> hidden: admin with reason
    hidden --> published: admin restores
    hidden --> removed: admin
    removed --> [*]
